Hey

19
00:00:51,813 --> 00:00:52,813
Yeah?

20
00:00:53,053 --> 00:00:54,545
When we get back
on the bus later…

21
00:00:56,534 --> 00:00:57,534
Sit next to me

22
00:01:05,023 --> 00:01:07,289
